# Method Fit Matrix

| Signal                                       | Best method            |
|----------------------------------------------|------------------------|
| 2-3 options, low uncertainty                 | Weighted Matrix        |
| Multi-attribute conflict (perf/sec/cost)     | ATAM                   |
| Time-to-value dominates                      | Cost of Delay          |
| Strategic positioning, evolving landscape    | Wardley Mapping        |
| High uncertainty, big bet, deferred decision | Real Options           |
